## Scope note

This license covers the **code** in this repository (notebooks, scripts, `src/`,
`api/`, `dashboard/`, etc.) authored by the repository owner. It does **not**
apply to, and does not override the terms of, any third-party datasets
referenced or used by the projects in `projects/`, including but not limited to:

- HeadHunter (hh.ru) resume/vacancy exports (`projects/hh-resume-salary-eda`,
  `projects/hh-vacancy-employer-sql`)
- Kaggle competition datasets, e.g. `sf-booking` (`projects/hotel-rating-anomaly-detection`)
  and the NYC Taxi Trip Duration competition (`projects/nyc-taxi-trip-duration`)
- The UCI/Kaggle "Online Retail" transactions dataset (`projects/customer-segmentation-rfm`)
- The UCI red wine quality dataset (`projects/wine-quality-svm-classification`)
- CIAN.ru scraped listings and CBR macroeconomic data (`projects/real-estate-price-prediction`)

None of these raw datasets are redistributed in this repository (see each
project's `data/README.md` for source, access, and license/usage notes). Users
of this repository's code must independently obtain and comply with the license
terms of any dataset they use with it.
